.TH RETA\-MOJO 1 "July 2026" "reta_arch_mojo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
reta\-mojo \- developer facade for native Mojo Reta tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B reta\-mojo
.RI [ OPTION ]
.RI [ ARGUMENT ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B reta\-mojo
is a developer facade for the native Mojo implementation. It dispatches selected \-\-mojo\-* modes to the corresponding native helper when available.

.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success and non-zero on errors, failed checks, missing build targets, or invalid arguments.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR reta(1), rp(1), rpl(1), rpe(1), rpb(1), reta-mojo(1)
